=== Text #16 ===
> [Art]ikPix is an app designed to help children improve their speech production at the word and sentence levels. This app is convenient for articulation practice and takes very little time[ on the part of the] clinician to set up. This app also gives you the option of taking your own photos or importing pictures to create your own flashcards to use. There is a data collection feature and a recording option. Some downfalls of this app include the inability to remove unwanted words or pictures and you can only work on[ one] target at a time.[][][][][]

